## Notes
- Frontend reads `VITE_API_BASE_URL` and no longer depends on localhost.
- The current backend includes persistent firewall proxy code that is not a fit for Vercel as-is.
- If you want the firewall functionality hosted too, that part needs a separate always-on platform.